    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>292275,292325</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>マクスウェルと……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What to do with Maxwell?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Speakers>
  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>291228</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>むむ？　今度はワシに何を
させようというのじゃ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmm? Now, what do you
need this old man for?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>291408</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>威勢のよい子らじゃ。
このワシとまた戦うと？
年寄り遣いが荒いのう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You're awfully mighty kiddos.
You want to fight this old man?
You're too rough on your elders...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>291408</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>まぁよい、
やってやろうではないか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But I suppose it's fine.
Let's start, then.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>291408</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>準備はよいぞ、
いつでもかかってくるのじゃ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm ready for you. Attack
me whenever you like.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>291480</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>降参降参……
また強くなったの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, I submit! You've
gotten stronger still...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>291660</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>マクスウェル！
オレらに力を貸してくれ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Maxwell! Lend us your power!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>291804</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>何じゃ、この老体にまだ
無茶をさせようというのか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What's this? You want to force a little
more fight out of these old bones?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>291804</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも、ま、よかろう。
そなたらに
力を貸すとしようかな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, that's alright.
I suppose I have got
the power to lend.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>291932</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>我、今、分子の精に
ねがいたてまつる</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Here and now, I offer my request
to the Spirit of Molecules.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>291932</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>指輪の盟約のもと、
我に精霊を従わせたまえ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>By covenant of the ring,
may this spirit obey me.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>291932</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>我が名は&lt;Dio&gt;</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>My name is &lt;Dio&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>292008</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>この老いぼれになんでも
任せるがよい</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You can leave all you
like up to this old fool.</EnglishText>
      <Notes>not sure about this phrasing -dragon
</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Problematic</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>292232</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>残念じゃが、契約の指輪を
持っていない者とは
契約できぬ決まりじゃ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's unfortunate, but I can't form
a pact with someone who doesn't
have a pact ring.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>292232</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ターコイズを
探してくるんじゃな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You'll have to bring
me the Turquoise Ring.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
